    "title": "Fire breaks out at homeless encampment in Providence - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By NBC 10 NEWS ,\n18 hours ago PROVIDENCE, R.I. (WJAR) — The Providence Fire Department responded to a late-night fire at a homeless encampment on Tuesday. The fire broke out under a bridge where Route 10 and Cranston Street meet. The fire department said nobody was at the site when firefighters arrived. No injuries were reported. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
